# The build context is an allowlist: nothing enters the image unless it is named below.
# The repository root holds a developer's real .env (git-ignored, but a Docker build does
# not read .gitignore), database files and virtual environments; a blanket "copy
# everything" must never be able to carry any of them into an image layer.
*

!requirements.txt
!alembic.ini
!house_helper
!deploy/ops
!deploy/logging.json

# Caches inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
